cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: beam_calculator
abstract: >-
  Desktop program for the design of reinforced concrete beams of a typical
  floor according to ABNT NBR 6118: slab load distribution, continuous beam
  analysis, longitudinal reinforcement and stirrup design, deflection checks,
  bar detailing, quantities, drawings and design report. Academic work
  (undergraduate thesis, Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Sul).
authors:
  - given-names: Artur Kalil
    family-names: Corrêa
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Sul
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/arturkcorr3a/beam_calculator"
keywords:
  - reinforced concrete
  - concreto armado
  - beam design
  - structural engineering
  - ABNT NBR 6118
